### Patch entry by ID (partial update - only provided fields are updated)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/entries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numberValue": 42
}

### Patch entry - update multiple fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/entries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selectorValue": "New Option",
  "freeText": "Updated text only"
}
